//
// Lagrange: (n - 1) [x^(n-1)] f^k = k [x^(n-1-k)] (x / g)^(n-1) for 0 < k < n. power_projection
// gives a[k] = [x^(n-1)] f^k, so H = sum_(j < n-1) a[n-1-j] / (n-1-j) x^j = (x / g)^(n-1) / (n - 1)
